#: ../../release_notes/compatibility_table.rst:52
msgid ""
"|morpheus| 9.0.0 embeds MySQL 8.4.8 and supports external MySQL "
"configuration, including the 8.4 LTS family. This entry does not certify "
"every external patch, managed-service variant, later major version, or "
"innovation release."
