"required. See the `Nutanix Compatibility and Interoperability table "
"<https://portal.nutanix.com/page/documents/compatibility-"
"interoperability-"
"matrix/software?partnerName=Morpheus%20Data&solutionType=all&componentVersion=all&hypervisor=all&validationType=all>`_"
" for additional information"
msgstr "Für |morpheus|-Version 6.3.4 und höher ist Nutanix AOS-Version 6.5.3.7+ erforderlich. Siehe die `Nutanix Compatibility and Interoperability table <https://portal.nutanix.com/page/documents/compatibility-interoperability-matrix/software?partnerName=Morpheus%20Data&solutionType=all&componentVersion=all&hypervisor=all&validationType=all>`_ für weitere Informationen"

